==Restrictions==
Unit Restriction: Only [[Secret Crush Cat (Special Cat)|Secret Crush Cat]], [[Tomboy Lion Cat (Special Cat)|Tomboy Lion Cat]], [[Chalkboard Eraser Cat (Special Cat)|Chalkboard Eraser Cat]], [[Class Rep Cat (Special Cat)|Class Rep Cat]], [[Principal Cat (Special Cat)|Principal Cat]] and [[Occultist Cat (Special Cat)|Occultist Cat]]

==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Confessional Tree (Enemy Base)|Confessional Tree]].
*1 [[Red Wind]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*1 [[White Wind]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[Dark Wind]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[White Wind]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[White Wind]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**3 [[Red Wind]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**3 [[Dark Wind]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**20 [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Spam any of the [[Heartbeat Catcademy (Event Gacha)|Heartbeat Catcademy]] Units to win.

